18:56:23 [ecd8] Target developmental level: age 5, approx MLU 6-8 words per utterance. Keep sentences at or near this length.
18:56:23 [ecd8] 
18:56:23 [ecd8] Weave these language targets naturally into narration and dialogue (model them in context; do not drill or quiz them in the story):
18:56:23 [ecd8] - plural forms (Regular plural nouns): e.g. dogs, cars, apples, cats, toys
18:56:23 [ecd8] - ing form (Present participle/progressive verb form): e.g. running, jumping, eating, playing
18:56:23 [ecd8] - pronouns later (Later developing pronouns: possessive and plural third-person forms): e.g. her, his, they, their
18:56:23 [ecd8] - location noun (Location concept expressed with a noun phrase): e.g. in the box, on the table, under the chair
18:56:23 [ecd8] - simple conjunction (Early conjunction use): e.g. and, or
18:56:23 [ecd8] - intermediate conjunction (Pre-school conjunction use): e.g. because, but, so, if
18:56:23 [ecd8] 
