18:56:23 [ecd8] - advanced sounds [th, r, ch] (Late-developing speech sounds for articulation practice.): e.g. thumb, three, rabbit, red, chair, cheese
18:56:23 [ecd8] 
18:56:23 [ecd8] Build the story around this interest theme — use it for the story's hook, characters, and setting:
18:56:23 [ecd8] - fairies (fairy, magic wand, wings)
18:56:23 [ecd8] 
